      "writtenOn": "2023-08-02T21:04:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Slightly gave up here because this is already too big. This needs to call a function which takes an `SkBitmap`, but there is no such thing as a non-mutating `SkBitmap`. Also, this is a marker in the code that we don\u0027t want the bitmap to mutate, but this practically unenforced. `SkImage`(`SkImage_Raster`), `SkBitmap`, and `SkPixelRef` never actually enforce any sort of immutability and just blindly const cast everywhere. We may want to see about cleaning that up.",
      "revId": "8eb739a668916dc756ace65469eb90b569cfd9e3",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
